# Keep Amendment 004 recovery artifacts byte-exact.
#
# Git's core.autocrlf normalization rewrote committed evidence in the original
# Amendment 004 commit, so the recorded SHA-256 values did not reproduce from the
# repository blob. Marking these files `-text` disables newline conversion, which
# makes the committed blob byte-identical to the working-tree artifact and lets a
# single canonical SHA-256 describe both.
*
-text
